    <item>Unit: YM-000026, selected trace-scale gallery route.

    <item>Status: draft. This unit proves the scalar gap interpolation, the
    strict subsequence recursion, and the finite-dimensional
    ultrafilter/test-limit passage. It identifies the exact selected public
    producer of the one-scale chart family and cross-references the existing
    corrected-panel and calibration proofs. Upstream paid-chart and
    finite-volume estimates are not newly reproved here.

